# Runs in each look: Glass shows the floating glass field; Material the 56 px pill in the docked view.
ipc panels open spotlight IRICE-TEST
wait 1
shot spot-open
note Glass: the floating glass field. Material: the 56 px pill in the docked view. Same drawing as QML in this look.
key -k Escape
wait 1
# MANUAL: switch look (config) and reopen: the other drawing appears
# MANUAL: right after a shell reload plus 3 s: rec first open; first moving frame no later than a second open and no later than QML (anim-timing.py)
rec sp-first 1 ipc panels open spotlight IRICE-TEST
note First open in this file's run: first moving frame no later than a second open, and no later than QML.
wait 1
key -k Escape
